though, as up to that point she'd also not found any bags other than
of tricks.  And dead Perseus had only a c[oLev.)  On the other side of
the drawbridge (which has already squashed a few R and L and such),
predictably, is a soldier with a /oD.

I'm not so big on the potential instant death thing.

So, options that I can think of: open the thing, then fire away with
Mjollnir and/or an attack wand and hope for the best (with my choice
of displacement or invisibility); go up and wander around, hoping a
useful item will show up; use the ?oGeno I just noticed I have to nuke
all soldiers (a bit silly, and it'll still leave the wand lying around
for something else to pick up); or go around to the back of the castle
and try more subtlety, though I don't know that that improves matters.

Anything I didn't think of?  Or other wisdom?
